  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6011.02 Definition of Officer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6011.02 Definition of Officer. “Officer”, for the purposes of this part, means any person who is assigned any of the following ranks or titles:\n\n(a) Director;\n\n(b) Executive director;\n\n(c) Fire chief;\n\n(d) Assistant fire chief;\n\n(e) Deputy fire chief;\n\n(f) Commissioner;\n\n(g) Fire engineer;\n\n(h) Fireward;\n\n(i) President;\n\n(j) Vice-president;\n\n(k) Secretary;\n\n(l) Treasurer; or\n\n(m) General manager.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 6000) #13094, eff 8-25-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6000.html"
